# Design System

Reference: `docs/design/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md`, `docs/design/COLOR_SYSTEM.md`, `docs/design/TYPOGRAPHY.md`, `docs/design/SPACING_SYSTEM.md`

Visual design only. No workflow or business rules.

## Design language

Professional SaaS quality. Navy sidebar, light canvas, Novend teal primary
(`#0d9488`). Not Princellen orange. Not industry-specific palettes.

Target feel: large whitespace, simple hierarchy, rounded components, minimal
borders, subtle shadows, predictable interactions.

## Tokens

Use design tokens / CSS variables. Never invent one-off colors, font sizes, or
spacing values on a screen.

## Consistency

New screens must strengthen the existing design system. If a visual choice
cannot be expressed with current tokens, update the design system first.
